Body:
Confirmed: Increasing the timeout and chunkTimeout limits to very high values for providers needed -  resolves the SSE timeout issue entirely.

opencode.json Example: 
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "provider": {
    "github-copilot": {
      "options": {
        "timeout": 1200000,
        "chunkTimeout": 600000
      }
    },
    "opencode": {
      "options": {
        "timeout": 1200000,
        "chunkTimeout": 600000
      }
    }
  }
}
